ULL WHERE session_id=:id AND session_state=&apos;AWAITING_PLAN_APPROVAL&apos; AND state_version=:ver。若 rows_affected == 1，同事务将 leases 置为 holder=&apos;human&apos;，返回 200 OK (intercept_mode: "PRE_DISPATCH")。&#10;​尝试分支 B（Timer 在 10 毫秒前刚胜出，rows_affected == 0 且当前状态已变为 PLAN_APPROVED 或 RUNNING_DAG）：不向前端报错，立即在同一请求内无缝升级为强制抢占（Preemption）：&#10;​在 SQLite 事务中强制更新 leases 表：holder=&apos;human&apos;, lease_epoch=lease_epoch+1，将 pi_sessions.session_state 置为 HUMAN_OVERRIDE，工单置为 blocked；&#10;​同步调用算力适配器执行 adb shell kill -TERM -{pgid}（清理刚启动不到 1 秒的容器进程）；&#10;​返回 200 OK (intercept_mode: "POST_DISPATCH_PREEMPTED")。' resource-id="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox:id/assistant_robin_text" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[220,622][1014,2276]" /></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node><node index="2" text="" resource-id="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox:id/assistant_chat_history_footer" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,1926][1080,2276]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[468,1926][612,2070]" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox:id/assistant_robin_scroll_to_bottom_button" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.google.android.googlequickse